* A name r68 knows as a register, defined by the source itself (CCR equ $12), in another equ's
* value: that symbol, not an external of the name.
* fixed: 7fd7779 2026-10-12 r68togas: a register name in an equ value the source defines stays that symbol
* expect text: 203c0000 12004e71
CCR equ $12
Both equ (CCR<<8)
 psect equ_register_defined,0,0,0,0,0
 move.l #Both,d0
 nop
 ends
